    "detailed_description": "New York City just turned the Brooklyn bridge into a park, and the visitors are in desperate need of food! Now\u2019s your chance to make it big in the Big Apple! Build food booths, grow produce, or locally source ingredients until you're the only competition left in New Brooklyn Bridge Tycoon!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759000/extras/4372556e8b37e060bbac91bb95632e53.webp?t=1736204522\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br>Build your food shops and serve hungry customers.<br>Take care of your shops and upgrade them to be even better.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759000/extras/a16dfe2dd29d61147b6a3412bc91b849.webp?t=1736204522\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br>To make food, you will need ingredients.<br>Produce ingredients in factories or get them elsewhere, but your shops will need ingredients! <br>You can produce ingredients. But sometimes it's easier to buy them from others. <br>Have too many ingredients? Sell them to those in need!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759000/extras/aeb9504a2743e4e7b2622c2511b75f1f.webp?t=1736204522\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br>Competition is hard. Sometimes resorting to sabotage is the only option. Bend the rules, disrupt their shops and supply chains to tilt the playing field in your favor. <br>In the cutthroat world of food empires, only the most strategic and daring will thrive!",
    "about_the_game": "New York City just turned the Brooklyn bridge into a park, and the visitors are in desperate need of food! Now\u2019s your chance to make it big in the Big Apple! Build food booths, grow produce, or locally source ingredients until you're the only competition left in New Brooklyn Bridge Tycoon!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759000/extras/4372556e8b37e060bbac91bb95632e53.webp?t=1736204522\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br>Build your food shops and serve hungry customers.<br>Take care of your shops and upgrade them to be even better.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759000/extras/a16dfe2dd29d61147b6a3412bc91b849.webp?t=1736204522\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br>To make food, you will need ingredients.<br>Produce ingredients in factories or get them elsewhere, but your shops will need ingredients! <br>You can produce ingredients. But sometimes it's easier to buy them from others. <br>Have too many ingredients? Sell them to those in need!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759000/extras/aeb9504a2743e4e7b2622c2511b75f1f.webp?t=1736204522\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br>Competition is hard. Sometimes resorting to sabotage is the only option. Bend the rules, disrupt their shops and supply chains to tilt the playing field in your favor. <br>In the cutthroat world of food empires, only the most strategic and daring will thrive!",
    "short_description": "A management sim where you run your own food shops, serving hungry locals while keeping a close eye on your resources. Grow or buy fresh ingredients locally. The competition is fierce and sabotage is always on the menu. Defend your business, and rise to become the food lord!",
